---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact & Feedback – Get in Touch"
  description={`Contact the ${siteConfig.name} team for technical feedback, formula suggestions, template requests, and corrections.`}
  path="/contact/"
>
  <article class="content-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Support & Editorial Feedback</p>
    <h1>Contact {siteConfig.name}</h1>

    <p>
      We actively maintain {siteConfig.name} and appreciate feedback from knowledge workers, analysts, and readers.
      Whether you found an edge case in an Excel formula, need a specific Notion database template, or have ideas for a new workflow guide, we are here to listen.
    </p>

    <h2>Primary Contact Channel</h2>
    <p>For editorial questions, formula verification, bug reports, and partnership inquiries:</p>
    <p class="contact-email-box">
      <strong>Email:</strong>
      <a href="mailto:jacho0227@gmail.com">jacho0227@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      <em>Expected response time:</em> The editorial team reviews every message. Typical response within 24–48 hours.
    </p>

    <h2>How to Suggest a Guide or Report a Formula Issue</h2>
    <p>To help us verify and update guides quickly, please include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Application & Version:</strong> (e.g., Microsoft 365 Excel, Google Sheets, Notion desktop/web)</li>
      <li><strong>Operating System:</strong> (Windows 11, macOS, iPadOS)</li>
      <li><strong>Affected Guide URL:</strong> Link to the specific article</li>
      <li><strong>Formula / Scenario:</strong> The exact data structure, input values, and expected vs. actual output</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .content-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem; }
  p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  ul { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .contact-email-box {
    background: var(--color-bg-card, var(--color-bg-alt));
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }
  .contact-email-box a { color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
